      "cause": "The 160px Package and 225px Notes columns are constrained by the need to fit the full table within the viewport."
    },
    {
      "design": "d3r3B",
      "good": "The initial viewport shows the package and all three compact audit fields, with some of each note. Its 83px overflow is relatively modest.",
      "problems": "The inline date-fns identifier splits across lines, the advisory takes three lines, and note endings require scrolling. The package identifier also takes three lines.",
      "cause": "At 300px, Notes lands at an unfavorable wrapping point for date-fns and the advisory; Package remains 168px wide."
    }
  ],
